   "versionNonce": 734647022,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Can every stored before/after be re-expressed as an event over a node id, without guessing at a quote and\nwithout losing which passage was cited? If yes, take Option 1. If no, Option 2 is the honest choice and the graph\nstays a view. Deciding now costs one migration; deciding later costs either the audit trail or the graph, because\nboth are already written in the other key.",
   "originalText": "Can every stored before/after be re-expressed as an event over a node id, without guessing at a quote and\nwithout losing which passage was cited? If yes, take Option 1. If no, Option 2 is the honest choice and the graph\nstays a view. Deciding now costs one migration; deciding later costs either the audit trail or the graph, because\nboth are already written in the other key.",
   "fontSize": 13,
   "fontFamily": 1,
